{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"LANDING (local, validated — not yet pushed to Gerrit). Applied the four approved code-v3 threshold flips to src/rebar/llm/code_review/criteria_routing.json:\n- api-compat: advisory -> blocking@0.51 (overlay, already routed)\n- deletion-impact: advisory -> blocking@0.60 (content-triggered overlay)\n- regression: ADDED as blocking@0.54 (BASE reviewer dimension, exec:AGENT/applies_to:[] inert; only posture/threshold/blocking_enabled consulted by threshold_for)\n- error-handling: ADDED as blocking@0.50 (BASE dimension, same mechanism)\n\nMechanism verified: registry.threshold_for resolves (0.51/0.60/0.54/0.50, True) for each; base dims are picked up by threshold_for but ignored by det_criteria/glob_triggered_overlays/content_triggered_overlays (confirmed unchanged). Resolution is min-threshold/any-enabled, so a multi-tagged finding (e.g. [correctness, regression]) now blocks at 0.54; [correctness] alone stays advisory (0.95, False).\n\nUpdated 3 deliberate governance-pin tests to the newly-approved blocking set {secret-detection, high-critical-security, security, api-compat, deletion-impact, regression, error-handling}: test_impact_model_versioning.py, test_code_review_ws2.py, test_code_review_deletion_impact.py. Full targeted sweep: 713 passed (code_review/routing/criteria/decide/blocking/impact_model).\n\nDeliverables copied to docs/experiments/: calibrate_code_review_thresholds.py, code-review-threshold-calibration.md, escaped_bug_analysis.py, escaped-bug-review-gap-analysis.md.\n\nREMAINING: the Gerrit landing ceremony (set file_impact, review-plan attestation to claim, fresh worktree off origin/main, make lint, commit with rebar-ticket trailer + -s, push gerrit HEAD:refs/for/main, LLM-Review+1 AND Verified+1, submit, then close). Pausing here for operator go-ahead on the external push."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787071932841869001,"uuid":"f9ed11d5-4372-49b9-aeb2-51da4112de99"}